# Template only. Copy outside the checkout, protect it with chmod 600, and supply
# actual IDs/paths. Secrets are read from protected files; never paste PEM here.
# SNode.C accepts these dotted keys through --config-file /absolute/settings.conf.
# Database ownership is deliberately CLI-only: database --mode unmanaged|managed.

